  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.24 “Primary dwelling” shall mean an existing single-family, stand-alone structure, owned and occupied by a person or persons and such structure is used as the individual's primary residence, and not a rental, income, vacation home, transient residence, hotel or motel.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15",
